OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather to mark Armistice
OL,4,ADay silence
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across south-east England have
OL,7,Ffallen silent to mark Remembrance Day
OL,8,Fand pay their respects to people who
OL,9,Fdied fighting in the armed forces.
OL,11,FServices in Brighton, Chatham, Redhill
OL,12,Fand across the region stopped for a
OL,13,Ftwo-minute silence to mark Armistice
OL,14,FDay.
OL,16,FThe annual services across the country
OL,17,Fare held to mark the anniversary of the
OL,18,Fend of World War One on 11 November,
OL,19,Fand remember those who lost their lives
OL,20,Fin all wars the UK has been involved
OL,21,Fin.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
