OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather to mark Armistice
OL,4,ADay silence
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Dugdale, who joined crowds at The
OL,7,FBelfry shopping centre in Redhill,
OL,8,FSurrey, said: "My two grandfathers both
OL,9,Ffought, so its important for me to come
OL,10,Fto this."
